OL,3,GNEWSAFormer bus driver, 91, honoured
OL,4,Awith her own stop
OL,5,
OL,6,FRetired bus driver Pat Gwyther, 91, has
OL,7,Fbeen honoured for her decades of
OL,8,Fservice with a personalised bus stop.
OL,10,FPat said she was one of the only women
OL,11,Fat Nottingham City Transport to drive
OL,12,Fbuses when she first took the wheel in
OL,13,F1971.
OL,15,FOperator, trentbarton, acknowledged her
OL,16,Flong service with a sign, which family
OL,17,Fand carers have recommended Pat
OL,18,Fdisplays in her bedroom.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
