OL,3,GNEWSAFormer bus driver, 91, honoured
OL,4,Awith her own stop
OL,5,
OL,6,FPat is keen to see the "proper stop"
OL,7,Fdisplayed on the street outside her
OL,8,Fcare home in Sandiacre, Derbyshire,
OL,9,Fbut, for now, it is in her bedroom.
